      "problem": "read_regular uses lstat/read_bytes/lstat without a held no-follow descriptor, path/handle identity comparison, complete metadata baselines or a parent recheck after reading. A temporary final-path or parent substitution can be followed between the two observations. Expected SHA pins prevent promoting foreign bytes as valid evidence but do not prevent reading a transient foreign/link target.",
